@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Sequence.puml

title 1. Регистрации устройства. Сквозной процесс

actor User
participant "Web/Mobile\nUI" as ui
participant "<<Container>>\nAPI \nGateway" as Api
participant "<<Container>>\nDevice Registry Service" as Registry
database "Registry DB" as RegistryDb
queue "Event Bus" as EventBus
participant "<<Container>>\nDevice Management Service" as Mgmt
database "Device Management DB" as MgmtDb

User -> ui : Нажимает "Зарегистрировать устройство"
ui -> Api : POST /devices
Api -> Api: check / create session
Api -> Registry : POST /devices + JWT
Registry -> RegistryDb : INSERT new device
RegistryDb --> Registry : OK
Registry --> Api : 201 Created
Api --> ui : Устройство зарегистрировано
Registry -> EventBus : DeviceRegistered event
EventBus -> Mgmt : DeviceRegistered
Mgmt -> MgmtDb : INSERT device\nstatus=REGISTERED,\ndesired={}, reported={}
MgmtDb --> Mgmt : OK

@enduml
